   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2002-03-20",
   "text": "Amends Federal transportation law to extend, beginning on September 22, 2001 through December 31, 2003, the period of time during which air carrier liability for third party damages as a result of a terrorist act may be limited to no more than $100 million, in the aggregate, for all claims arising out of such act."
